WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.531 --> 00:00:14.832
here's your sleeping bag.

2
00:00:15.292 --> 00:00:15.893
Have fun!"

3
00:00:16.473 --> 00:00:17.174
Mom said.

4
00:00:17.194 --> 00:00:21.017
"See you tomorrow, Mom," I said.

5
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:24.320
I was having a sleepover at Steve's house.

6
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.842
It was my first one.

7
00:00:26.862 --> 00:00:29.404
"Hi Jim!"

8
00:00:30.788 --> 00:00:32.769
Steve was waiting for me at the door.

9
00:00:32.789 --> 00:00:35.110
"Let's put your stuff in my room.

10
00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:38.011
Then we can go outside to rollerblade."

11
00:00:38.031 --> 00:00:40.012
"Sounds great!"

12
00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:41.193
I said.

13
00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:44.915
Steve brought me upstairs.

14
00:00:48.716 --> 00:00:51.217
In his room he had lots of cool toys.

15
00:00:53.098 --> 00:00:56.420
He also had a white guinea pig named Ghost.

16
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.421
Soon we were rollerblading outside.

17
00:01:02.441 --> 00:01:06.744
"Watch this spin," Steve said.

18
00:01:06.764 --> 00:01:09.445
"Nice move.

19
00:01:09.825 --> 00:01:12.247
Watch me jump," I said.

20
00:01:15.048 --> 00:01:17.590
Steve's mom called us inside for dinner.

21
00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:21.072
"Time for pizza, boys!"

22
00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:28.696
After dinner we played video games.

23
00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:31.736
Then we went to bed.

24
00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:34.877
Steve's mom turned off the lights.

25
00:01:34.897 --> 00:01:37.258
"Don't stay up too late.

26
00:01:37.658 --> 00:01:38.678
Good night."

27
00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:41.839
"Good night," we said.

28
00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.440
But we couldn't sleep.

29
00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:50.241
We laughed and told spooky stories until Steve's mom came back.

30
00:01:50.261 --> 00:01:54.403
"Boys," she said.

31
00:01:54.423 --> 00:01:56.663
"It's getting late.

32
00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.004
Go to sleep, please."

33
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.662
"Okay," we said.

34
00:02:04.823 --> 00:02:06.624
For a while we were quiet.

35
00:02:07.925 --> 00:02:09.647
Then—thump! Bump!

36
00:02:13.009 --> 00:02:13.890
"What was that?"

37
00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.191
I whispered.

38
00:02:15.211 --> 00:02:17.632
"I don't know."

39
00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:19.914
Steve sounded scared too.

40
00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:22.976
We heard the sounds again.

41
00:02:22.996 --> 00:02:27.099
"I think there's a monster in the closet!"

42
00:02:27.559 --> 00:02:28.020
I said.

43
00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:30.601
"Oh no!"

44
00:02:31.561 --> 00:02:33.743
Steve pulled his blanket over his head.

45
00:02:34.743 --> 00:02:36.465
I hid under my blanket too.

46
00:02:37.705 --> 00:02:38.726
Thump! Bump!

47
00:02:39.887 --> 00:02:42.148
Steve stayed under the covers, hiding.

48
00:02:42.168 --> 00:02:45.350
"I want my mommy!"

49
00:02:47.752 --> 00:02:49.273
Soon it was quiet again.

50
00:02:50.434 --> 00:02:52.675
Slowly I peeked out.

51
00:02:53.896 --> 00:02:56.598
Across the room something was moving!

52
00:02:57.739 --> 00:03:01.913
I was about to scream—until I realized something.

53
00:03:01.933 --> 00:03:04.474
"Guess what, Steve.

54
00:03:06.074 --> 00:03:07.675
It's not a monster.

55
00:03:09.195 --> 00:03:10.295
It's Ghost!"

56
00:03:12.156 --> 00:03:13.996
Steve pulled the covers tighter.

57
00:03:14.016 --> 00:03:17.157
"A ghost?"

58
00:03:17.177 --> 00:03:18.838
I burst into laughter.

59
00:03:21.699 --> 00:03:22.939
"Not a ghost.

60
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:24.940
It's Ghost.

61
00:03:26.388 --> 00:03:29.310
Your guinea pig escaped from his cage!"

62
00:03:30.871 --> 00:03:31.972
Steve laughed too.

63
00:03:36.495 --> 00:03:38.316
He got up and put Ghost back.

64
00:03:39.537 --> 00:03:41.278
Soon we were both asleep.

65
00:03:43.199 --> 00:03:45.421
The next morning my mom picked me up.

66
00:03:45.441 --> 00:03:47.302
"Did you have fun?"

67
00:03:48.263 --> 00:03:49.704
"Yep!" I said.

68
00:03:49.724 --> 00:03:52.285
"We saw a ghost!"

69
00:03:52.305 --> 00:03:54.907
"What?" Mom said.

70
00:03:57.776 --> 00:04:00.802
I told her about Steve's guinea pig, and she laughed.

71
00:04:01.803 --> 00:04:04.648
Then we made plans for my second sleepover.

72
00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.835
Next weekend Steve was coming to my house!
